Caelza: renting from the Ether Hollow card and RC codes in the Shop (vision §9,
M10 slice 4). The routes, the spend gate and the triggers are in the overlay
module crates/caelza-gateway/src/api_world.rs; the card and the Shop's RC
entry are overlay web files. This patch adds the four routes
(/api/world/lots, /api/world/rent, /api/world/rent/pay, /api/world/redeem)
and the strings.

Applied by runtime/build.sh after the rename; regenerate with the same
`diff -u` when the upstream pin moves.

--- a/crates/caelza-gateway/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/caelza-gateway/src/lib.rs
@@ -2388,6 +2388,10 @@
         .route("/api/world/enter", post(api_world::handle_world_enter))
         .route("/api/world/leave", post(api_world::handle_world_leave))
         .route("/api/world/wake", post(api_world::handle_world_wake))
+        .route("/api/world/lots", get(api_world::handle_world_lots))
+        .route("/api/world/rent", post(api_world::handle_world_rent))
+        .route("/api/world/rent/pay", post(api_world::handle_world_rent_pay))
+        .route("/api/world/redeem", post(api_world::handle_world_redeem))
         // The Body (caelza-body over MCP) for the dashboard's Bodies page;
         // the gateway owns the connection and makes the tool calls.
         .route("/api/bodies/status", get(api_bodies::handle_bodies_status))
